      "arguments": "value text, max_length integer",
      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION private.is_adoption_instruction_plain_text(value text, max_length integer)\n RETURNS boolean\n LANGUAGE sql\n IMMUTABLE\nAS $function$\n  select value is not null\n    and char_length(btrim(value)) between 1 and max_length\n    and value !~* '(<|>|javascript:|https://|http://|www\\.)';\n$function$\n",
