      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION private.preserve_sponsorship_contact_submission()\n RETURNS trigger\n LANGUAGE plpgsql\n SET search_path TO 'public', 'pg_temp'\nAS $function$\nbegin\n if new.contact_submission is distinct from old.contact_submission then raise exception 'Submitted contact snapshot is immutable';end if;return new;\nend; $function$\n",
