      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION private.snapshot_sponsorship_proof_contact()\n RETURNS trigger\n LANGUAGE plpgsql\n SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public', 'pg_temp'\nAS $function$\nbegin\n select jsonb_build_object('name',s.name,'email',s.email,'phone',s.phone,'language',p.language,'source','proof_recorded','capturedAt',clock_timestamp()) into new.contact_snapshot\n from public.sponsorship_pledge p join public.supporter s on s.id=p.supporter_id where p.id=new.pledge_id;\n return new;\nend; $function$\n",
