      "arguments": "p_job uuid, p_actor uuid",
      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.crm_export_job_download(p_job uuid, p_actor uuid)\n RETURNS text\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public', 'pg_temp'\nAS $function$\r\n  select a.csv from public.crm_export_job j join private.crm_export_artifact a on a.job_id=j.id\r\n    where j.id=p_job and j.actor_user_id=p_actor and j.status='ready'\r\n      and j.expires_at>clock_timestamp() and private.crm_export_actor_allowed(p_actor);\r\n$function$\n",
