      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.volunteer_validate_policy_shape(p jsonb)\n RETURNS jsonb\n LANGUAGE sql\n IMMUTABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public', 'pg_temp'\nAS $function$\n select case when public.volunteer_policy_json_matches(p,public.volunteer_policy_json_schema()) then '[]'::jsonb else '[\"invalid_policy_structure\"]'::jsonb end;\n$function$\n",
